{"reviewId": "304379475_845mlPXxM", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "当创新拉不动增长时，经济体为了维持之前的增长速度，会选择加大投资。比如企业扩建厂房、政府增加基建项目，通过 “花钱” 的方式强行拉动经济。\n大规模投资会突然增加对各类资源的需求，包括大宗商品（钢铁、煤炭）、工业原料和劳动力。\n当需求快速增加而供给跟不上时，市场上的商品就会出现短缺，价格自然随之上涨。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "第一个是创新，即罗斯托说的主导部门问题，由于新的技术发明对劳动生产率的提升作用在繁荣的高潮期开始变弱，增长更多依赖于投资，从而造成价格上涨，这是一个常见的供需解释。", "range": "8269-8351", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "304379475_845mlPXxM", "userVid": 304379475, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761111782, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 304379475, "name": "夏杨", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/wcib2GksmGOk9ryziaPUQKnkPqIM3P7rwApZsibVDaJEdzNIwIjFqQ2ZZuOXjQEbvrlDWAONTKmOWI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "夏杨", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 226587094, "name": "柠檬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PVjNdPZ5hkXS6DjN4UAia08Ja4EmKOuiaicM6j6ImH51icKP3jib9R9WMlKe3d94dFSRe4y5uCLvg8UUc0V6nflpdWXCqYElMnUu8bcekpfxJibFU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "其实可以理解为惯性增长？但是假如需求端没有随着供给的增加，那么是不是最终价格还是会回落呢？", "reviewId": "304379475_845mlPXxM", "commentId": "304379475_845mlPX